direction: down
title: "map FrameSpec: source consumers, old-cohort lifetime and build impact"
s0: "scheme-frame-producer\nPer-successor liveness, return variable and internal\nsaved-register closure"
s1: "frame-freeze\nValidate kind/fs/link/map and preserve stored versus\nactual frame sizes"
s2: "descriptor-emission\nEmit exact constructor result; no reinterpretation or\nnew implicit layout"
s3: "stored-map-labels\nL2 normal(5,0,7), L4 normal(5,0,9); actual internal\ndescriptors remain distinct"
s4: "gc-frame-reader\nDecode same slots, scan selected roots, update moving\nreferences, keep return labels alive"
s5: "restore-reader\nCopy frame fields, preserve logical values and\ndenv/wind, reload roots before execution"
s6: "multishot-caller\nEach shot has fresh execution/native activation and\nshared Scheme identities"
s7: "module-fixup\nValidate semantic frame ABI and bind exact labels/OFD\ntables before entering module"
s8: "artifact-driver\nABI edit invalidates true descendants; a native tool\nedit cannot certify layout equivalence by itself"
s9: "frame-reflection\nReconstruction is a writer and never recreates expired\nnative authority"
s10: "old-cohort-retirement\nNo unload while captured return addresses/descriptors\nor actual native users remain"
