abi0: "liveness-content\nDo not rebuild whole runtime just because a mask\nvalue changes"
s8 -> abi0
abi1: "frame-wire-schema\nOld descriptor decoder retires only after old\nGC/capture/restore/label users close"
s8 -> abi1
abi2: "target-physical\nPortability remains parameterized; no universal\ncross-architecture saved continuation"
s8 -> abi2
abi3: "native-tool\nRetire repeated frontend work only with\ndependency and output equivalence"
s8 -> abi3
abi4: "no-change\nNo timestamps or same file names as reuse\nauthority"
s8 -> abi4
